{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"8b5228e78b73070616d3f720be8a821a304cb4c1f9cecdd103de4302d38ecaf2","digest":{"component_or_area":"test-coverage audit remediation & behavioral regression suite","key_entities":["index.lock TOCTOU","detached-HEAD local-ahead","_acquire_fcntl errno","fsck Check3","Jira link-sync inventory","dual-lock portability","change-detector tests","hasattr assertions","commit 2d1524ad8"],"problem_keywords":["test coverage","false confidence","change-detector tests","behavioral regression","source inspection","anti-pattern tests","documentation drift","concurrency","data safety","production paths"],"propositions":["Tests exist that assert against source text, private structure, or mere existence rather than actual behavior, creating false confidence in coverage.","Documented contracts lack behavioral regression tests, leaving gaps in verifiable contract enforcement.","Two production code paths (index.lock TOCTOU reclaim, detached-HEAD local-ahead) have insufficient coverage and require hardened tests.","Documentation drifts exist between code and docs (Jira link-sync inventory, dual-lock portability) that must be reconciled.","Concurrency and data-safety test coverage is missing; new tests must use deterministic barriers/instrumented seams, not timing-dependent sleeps.","The audit identified 9 anti-pattern source-inspection tests and borderline cases where behavioral tests are feasible and stronger; these must be converted or replaced."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785823900328273264,"uuid":"9145a408-f03e-4aa0-997e-105ac6257bce"}